<!--
  Rack tuning format:
    offset="x,y,z"         moves the item on the rack. Increase z to move it farther off the rack face.
    rotation="x,y,z"       adds local Euler rotation in degrees.
    scale="1"              scales all axes, or use scale="x,y,z" for per-axis scale.
    model="path"           forces a specific rack model/prefab path.
    prefer="mesh"          tries Meshfile before DropMeshfile. Default tries DropMeshfile first.
    keepFpv="true"         keeps ItemFpv children for modded prefabs that store the visible model there.
    colliderXY="1.15"      scales the pickup/placement collider width and height from renderer bounds.
    colliderMinXY="0.18"   minimum pickup/placement collider width and height.
    colliderZ="0.004"      collider thickness facing out from the rack. Keep this thin unless a weapon is very hard to target.
-->
